window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A fantasy tale of adventure, battle, love, and excitement awaits. Gryff readily calls Vin home as he wages war for its protection. Humanity and griffins braces for the inevitable showdown in an epic struggle against the Horde. Gryff is determined to focus on vital tasks, like staving off starvation, improving his lands, and building his base of operations.</p> <p>The griffins spring hope into a defeated humanity as they edge toward their full potential. Gryff knows they are the key to freeing Vin and is working to help them reach greatness. He will risk it all to get them the catalysts they need to excel. Will you dare to quest with the hero? Download now to join Gryff in his exploits and feats.</p>"; 
